SUMMARY:Music for All Saints and All Souls
DESCRIPTION:Sung by The Sixteen under Harry Christophers\, this programme
  mixes Lôbo's Missa pro defunctis with Victoria\, Byrd\, Harris\, Stanf
 ord and Parry. It is music for mourning\, remembrance and hope.\nPrice: 
 £15.00 - £45.00\nhttps://thesixteen.com/event/music-for-all-saints-and
